# The suite runs inside the CodeEraser superproject (this repository is
# mounted there as the `cli/tests` submodule); cargo's target/ and the
# product's own .ce/ state never belong to the suite's history — nor do
# the editor droppings and scratch files the superproject's own
# .gitignore names: git applies THAT file only above this repository's
# boundary (so does ce's walk), so the rules a nested tree needs live here.
target/
.ce/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
*.tmp
scratch/
